# Secrets — never commit. Rotate any key that has been pasted into a chat or terminal.
.env
.env.*
*.key

# Build output: regenerable from script.md, and large.
# Untracked but NOT disposable: episodes/*/out/vo/ is the synthesised voice cache, and on
# Gemini's free tier rebuilding one episode's worth costs a day of quota. Delete the mp4 and
# the frames freely; leave vo/ alone.
episodes/*/out/
# The ready-to-upload copy of the mp4 plus its thumbnail. Same bytes as out/, renamed to the
# video's title so YouTube prefills it — a deliverable, not source.
episodes/*/upload/
scratch/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
